<title>USA: Abacus says added to Russell 2000 index.</title>
<headline>Abacus says added to Russell 2000 index.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Ohio 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abacus Direct Corp said its stock has been added to the Russell 2000 index.</p>
<p>The company reported a net of $981,000 on revenues of $5.5 million in the first quarter, compared with a $251,000 net on revenues of $2.8 million the year before.</p>
<p>Its stock hit a a 52-week high of 34-1/4 Monday and traded at 33-1/4 in the afternoon, up 1/4.</p>
